{"id": "DfTfp1pREXk", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Mall ka chikna farsh roz phisalta hai… par paanv ko toh ghar ki ret ki aadat hai. Aakhir tak dekhna 🏜️\n\nRaat ke 2 baje, khaali mall mein Kesar akela pocha laga raha hai: band dukaanein, bhaagti ghadiyaan, bina rang ka shehar.\nSubah ki pehli dhoop mein geela farsh sone jaisa ho jaata hai… aur yaad aati hai Maa ka siro, dhaani, neher, aur Dada jo hans ke kaanta nikaal dete the.\nShift ke baad, apne chhote se kamre mein, woh jhole se ghar ki ret ek parat mein daalta hai… aur thake paanv usmein rakh deta hai.\n\n🎵 MAATI · MC Square, Bhaktaaa, Akshat Jakhar, Ansh4sure, Farak (Hustle 5 · Apna Homeground)\n@farakmaybe @akshatjakhar @mcsquare7000 @bhaktaaa  @ansh4sure \nUsko bhejo jo apne kamre mein thoda sa ghar rakhta hai 🏠\n\nMaati | Hustle 5 | MC Square | Akshat Jakhar | Farak | Rajasthani rap | ghar ki yaad | pardes | night shift\n\n#Maati #Hustle5 #GharKiYaad", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1793763086, "like_count": 32577, "comment_count": 182, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1750124792715346a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 67.981, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQN1pxPoYlKuX-Sk-v0gwHuhf-0pIJlWZVjJOSfAOW9mnbaRNSruQjxtYpYpyan7XlWnLmK16j5fcn2SfHIC-C9m84RSTg0aVEClGHI.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=Ado7G8bqhVcbAf_fNWV4JDw067SDbLcBoQRYBcVp4cdZl0yAfUN7l3cTlAecnDC9_K2MQ8dKANhkI3o0MtVOuKnd&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=tBhYMcgqaVcQ7kNvwHajXPo&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=moX3O4t